Petitioner has relied upon the following documents viz: "Ex PW1/1(OSR) is the copy of Aadhar Card of PW1;
Ex. PW1/2(OSR) is the copy of School ID Card of PW1;
Ex. PW1/3(Colly)(running into sixteen pages) are the original discharge summary and treatment record of PW1;
Ex. PW1/4(Colly)(running into eight pages) are the original medical bills;
Ex. PW1/5(OSR)(running into six pages) are the copies of educational certificates of PW1;
Ex. PW1/6(Colly) is the DAR; & Ex. PW1/7(OSR) is the copy of PAN Card."

He has relied upon the following documents : "Ex. R3W1/1 is the attested copy of Insurance Policy;
Ex. R3W1/2 is the notice U/o 12 Rule 8 CPC sent to driver and owner;
Ex. R3W1/3(colly) is the original postal receipt and track report; & Ex. R3W1/B is Power of Attorney."
